<title>PORTUGAL: Escudo seen holding steady at around 101 on mark.</title>
<headline>Escudo seen holding steady at around 101 on mark.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The escudo was expected to trade quietly steady at around 101 to the mark on Monday with no significant factors influencing trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>The currency was trading at 101.01/04 to the mark at 0920 GMT compared with its close at 100.96/01 on Friday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
